  PlayerCount: 3
  SizeTag: LARGE / 6P
  Description: "Six holds set on a ring, each walled from its neighbours by
    mountains that belong to nobody. Wood inside your own ground, iron on the
    marches, and a Node between every pair of you — shared, so the thing
    coming out of it is never only your problem. Nothing is claimed until you
    have a culture to claim it with."
